# Build output of this throwaway probe crate.
#
# The root .gitignore only covers `/target` (the workspace root), so a nested
# crate like this one needs its own rule — otherwise `git add` would sweep in
# hundreds of compiler artifacts.
/target/
# Same convention as docs/research/spike/: a throwaway crate does not commit a
# lockfile (there is no reproducibility contract with a disposable probe).
Cargo.lock
